    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Manase Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Manase ŋitomon ka ŋiarei ŋina esyakinia iŋes akipuka Yudaya. Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋatomonikan ka ŋikan. Arae toto keŋ Episiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosec Manase aneni ke Ekapolon, kiwuap ŋakiro ŋuna aronok nooi ŋuna sek etiyaete ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin ŋulu eritari Ekapolon alokiŋaren Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes toduku nabo ŋakiboisyo nenimukur ŋuna koloŋ abwaŋabwaŋaari papa keŋ Esekia, ŋuna arae ŋakilipet ŋakujo. Toduku iŋes ŋamuroeta ŋuna ilipere Baal. Kitiyau iŋes etorube a akuj a ŋinaberu a ŋina anyaritae Asera, lopite ŋolo koloŋ etiyaa erwosit Aab ŋolo a Ŋisirael. Kilip Manase tari neni a ŋikacer ka abu kitiya aŋuna kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toduk iŋes ŋamuroeta ŋuna ilipere ŋakujo ŋunagelae tooma Akai ka Akuj, neni koloŋ abala Ekapolon, “Yerusalem bon iŋes ekelipere ayoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toduku iŋes ŋamuroeta ŋuna elipere ŋikacer nalapatui ŋunaarei alo Kai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toar lokoku keŋ tope erae amuronot. Adwarenene iŋes, nabo torae emuron; alosenene lomurok ka lolilae. Tosec iŋes nooi aneni ke Ekapolon kitoŋo iŋes Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu kiwuak etorube ŋolo ecieunitae ŋolo ka akuj a ŋinaberu a ŋina anyaritae Asera tooma kai ka Akuj, neni koloŋ alimokinit Ekapolon Daudi ka lokoku keŋ Solomon ebe, “Kai ka Akuj na ane alo Yerusalem, iŋes aseu ayoŋ anakwap a daadaŋ a ŋina a ŋikabilae a ŋulutomon ka ŋiarei a Ŋisirael atemar ekelipere ayoŋ ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajoŋoe ayoŋ akisirimit Ŋisirael anakwap a ŋina abu oinak atapapaa kec, erae ca kiwuapa ikes ŋuna daadaŋ abu ayoŋ ecik ikes ka ŋikisila daadaŋ ŋulu ecikit Moses eketiyan kaŋ ikes kiwuapa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ikes towout akiirar. Abu Manase kibata ikes akitiya aronis ŋina eloit nooi ŋina a ŋakwapin a ŋuna abu Ekapolon kirita alokiŋaren Ŋisirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu Ekapolon ŋakiro alokadwarak a ŋulu arae ŋiketiyak keŋ tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aŋuna etiyaa Manase erwosit a Yudaya asiilyo na, aronis ŋina iloit ŋina a Ŋiamori a ŋulu sek aya neni ipukat iŋes, ka nabo aŋuna arikokinia ŋituŋa a Yudaya nasecit ŋina ka akiwuapit ŋakujo keŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebala tokona Ekapolon ŋolo erae Akuj a Ŋisirael ebe, ‘Ayauni ayoŋ Yerusalem ka Yudaya akisicanet ŋina ani iirari ŋinituŋanan, ebuli tolilimiyo akuwan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esicani ayoŋ Yerusalem lopite ŋolo abu esicania Samaria. Esicani lopite ŋolo esicania Aab ŋolo arae erwosit a Isirael kaapei ka ŋiletok keŋ. Ani ŋituŋa a Yerusalem, apyaari pye, kidoŋ Yerusalem eorori ikoni atuba ŋina ilotaryo, ido tobuburiyarae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajali ayoŋ ŋituŋa ŋulu a Yerusalem ŋulu idoŋete, epoto oinak lomoe kec, ilounete ŋimoe ŋul ikes, kikamasi akwap kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyae ayoŋ ŋakiro ŋun lotuŋa kaŋ, anerae etiyata ikes aronis alokiŋaren kaŋ ka eketoŋoa ayoŋ nooi, ŋinapei ameun akoloŋit ŋina aponiata atapapaa kec alo Ijipit akitodol tari tokona.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari nabo daŋ, aarit Manase ŋituŋa ŋulu alalak nooi alo Yerusalem pa esecito, toleleiyaasi ŋaokot ameun alowae a epei akitodol lowae ŋoloce. Kiyatakin ŋun nasecit ŋina arikokinia iŋes ŋituŋa a Yudaya nasecit kitiyata ŋuna aronok aneni ke Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo a Manase ŋuluce daadaŋ, ŋuna daadaŋ etiyae iŋes kaapei ka asecit keŋ, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Manase totwan, tonukae neni anukitae atapapaa keŋ, lamanikor ka apukan ŋolo arae ŋolo a Usa. Kilunyokin Amon ŋolo arae lokoku keŋ lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Yudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Amon Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru ka Amon ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiarei ŋina esyakinia akipuka. Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋiarei. Arae toto keŋ Mesulemes nakoku keŋ ka Arus a ŋolo alo Yosoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes kitiya ŋuna aronok aneni ke Ekapolon lopite ŋolopei etiyator Manase ŋolo arae papa keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekwaan per ŋipitesyo keŋ daadaŋ ka ŋulu a papa keŋ, etiyanakini ŋakujo ŋunapei etiyanakini papa keŋ, elipi neni a ŋakujo a ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes toŋer Ekapolon, Akuj ŋina atapapaa keŋ, toesik akiwuapit ŋakiro keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋikapolok ŋulu epukato ka Amon totuko, toara Amon alokai ka apukan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya ŋuluce toara ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulusek aarete erwosit Amon, tosodo kituruwosi Yosia lokoku ka Amon erwosit, kilunyokin lokicoloŋ a papa keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo ka Amon ŋuluce daadaŋ, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi tonukae iŋes lomanikor a Usa. Kiluny nai Yosia ŋolo arae lokoku keŋ lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Yudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
